{"questions":[{"question_id":"1l4atb191","paperTitle":"IIT-JEE 2010 Paper 2 Offline","year":2010,"examDate":2010,"subject":"physics","chapter":"work-power-and-energy","chapterGroup":"mechanics","topic":"work","type":"mcq","marks":3,"negMarks":1,"permalink":"pa-block-of-mass-2-kg-is-free-to-move-along-the-x-axis-it-jee-advanced-physics-units-and-measurements-o5efl5g6tmv7kfju","content":"<p>A block of mass 2 kg is free to move along the x-axis. It is at rest and from t = 0 onwards, it is subjected to a time-dependent force F(t) in the x-direction. The force F(t) varies with t as shown in the figure. The kinetic energy of the block after 4.5 s is</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1l4bkrh4r/41205e7d-b7c1-4f7c-87bb-b61a42d8b283/4d47f4b0-ea74-11ec-a537-3baab2e403e6/file-1l4bkrh4s.png?format=png\" data-orsrc=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/1l4bkrh4r/41205e7d-b7c1-4f7c-87bb-b61a42d8b283/4d47f4b0-ea74-11ec-a537-3baab2e403e6/file-1l4bkrh4s.png\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0px auto;max-height:40vh\" alt=\"IIT-JEE 2010 Paper 2 Offline Physics - Work Power &amp; Energy Question 8 English\" srcset=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/500/image/1l4bkrh4r/41205e7d-b7c1-4f7c-87bb-b61a42d8b283/4d47f4b0-ea74-11ec-a537-3baab2e403e6/file-1l4bkrh4s.png?format=png 500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/750/image/1l4bkrh4r/41205e7d-b7c1-4f7c-87bb-b61a42d8b283/4d47f4b0-ea74-11ec-a537-3baab2e403e6/file-1l4bkrh4s.png?format=png 750w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1l4bkrh4r/41205e7d-b7c1-4f7c-87bb-b61a42d8b283/4d47f4b0-ea74-11ec-a537-3baab2e403e6/file-1l4bkrh4s.png?format=png 1000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1500/image/1l4bkrh4r/41205e7d-b7c1-4f7c-87bb-b61a42d8b283/4d47f4b0-ea74-11ec-a537-3baab2e403e6/file-1l4bkrh4s.png?format=png 1500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2000/image/1l4bkrh4r/41205e7d-b7c1-4f7c-87bb-b61a42d8b283/4d47f4b0-ea74-11ec-a537-3baab2e403e6/file-1l4bkrh4s.png?format=png 2000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2500/image/1l4bkrh4r/41205e7d-b7c1-4f7c-87bb-b61a42d8b283/4d47f4b0-ea74-11ec-a537-3baab2e403e6/file-1l4bkrh4s.png?format=png 2500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 720px\" decoding=\"async\"></p>","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"4.50 J"},{"identifier":"B","content":"7.50 J"},{"identifier":"C","content":"5.06 J"},{"identifier":"D","content":"14.06 J"}],"correct_options":["C"],"explanation":"<p>The t - F diagram is a straight line passing through (0, 4) and (3, 0). The equation of this straight line is</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.816ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"12.981ex\" height=\"2.79ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -872.7 5737.6 1233.3\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D439\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D439\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1026.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2082.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(2860.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(220,394) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(220,-345) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g><rect width=\"553.6\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(3654.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D461\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D461\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(4237.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(5237.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>.</p>\n<p>Newton's second law gives acceleration of the block as</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.816ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20.312ex\" height=\"2.773ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -864.9 8978.1 1225.5\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D44E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D44E\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(806.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1862.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D439\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D439\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2611.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"2F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2F\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(3111.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D45A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45A\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(4267.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(5323.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(6101.1,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(220,394) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(220,-345) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g><rect width=\"553.6\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(6894.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D4